        <mxCell id="flow-step-details-text-11" value="&#10;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Step S11: Curated Database to Encryption at Rest &amp; Transit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot;&gt;Save approved data to curated store&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot;&gt;Quick meaning&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- This makes trusted data available for use.&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- Direction: One-way data flow&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- Transport: Data encryption enforcement on port KMS/Key Vault policy&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- Path: Not specified&lt;br/&gt;&#10;- Security check: KMS/Key Vault policy&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot;&gt;In one line&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&#10;Data moves from &lt;b&gt;Curated Database&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;b&gt;Encryption at Rest &amp; Transit&lt;/b&gt; in step &lt;b&gt;S11&lt;/b&gt;.&#10;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="408" width="1420" height="260" as="geometry" />
